{"seq":2,"slug":"message-encryption","title":"负载加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-push-notifications/deliver/message-encryption","wordCount":1639,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"负载加密\">负载加密</h1><p>推送服务是一个你既不能选、也无法信任的中间人：它替你把消息转发给浏览器，却没有任何理由让它看得见消息内容。所以 Web Push 规定，负载必须在离开你的服务器之前就完成端到端加密，推送服务只碰得到密文。这套机制由 RFC 8291 定义，它不是可选的&quot;增强安全&quot;，而是带负载推送的硬性前提——你在<a href=\"../subscribe/push-subscription\">订阅 PushSubscription</a>里存下的那两把密钥 <code>p256dh</code> 与 <code>auth</code>，全部为它而存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这套加密由四样材料与两级派生构成，先把它们立好，后文才好展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>p256dh</code></td>\n<td>订阅自带的浏览器 ECDH 公钥，发件方拿它做密钥协商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>auth</code></td>\n<td>订阅自带的 16 字节认证密钥，作为 HKDF 的额外盐绑定这条订阅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临时密钥对 / salt</td>\n<td>发件方<strong>每条消息</strong>现生成，提供前向保密并让同一明文密文不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ECDH 共享密钥</td>\n<td>双方各用自己的私钥乘对方公钥，算出同一个点，取 x 坐标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两轮 HKDF</td>\n<td>第一轮盐用 <code>auth</code> 派生 IKM，第二轮盐用 <code>salt</code> 派生 AES 密钥与 nonce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>aes128gcm</code></td>\n<td>内容编码，把 salt、记录大小、临时公钥封进负载自带的头里</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"加密要凑齐的四样东西\">加密要凑齐的四样东西</h2><p>RFC 8291 的加密不是&quot;拿一把密钥 AES 一下&quot;那么简单，它要在发件方（你的服务器）和收件方（浏览器）之间，凭订阅时交换的公开信息，各自独立算出同一把对称密钥。凑齐下面四样，才能开始：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料</th>\n<th>来自</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订阅公钥 <code>p256dh</code></td>\n<td><code>PushSubscription.keys.p256dh</code></td>\n<td>浏览器的 ECDH 公钥，发件方拿它做密钥协商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证密钥 <code>auth</code></td>\n<td><code>PushSubscription.keys.auth</code>（16 字节）</td>\n<td>作为 HKDF 的额外盐，绑定这条订阅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临时密钥对</td>\n<td>发件方每条消息现生成</td>\n<td>提供前向保密：一次一密，不复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机盐 salt</td>\n<td>发件方每条消息现生成（16 字节）</td>\n<td>喂进 HKDF，保证同一明文每次密文不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意&quot;临时密钥对&quot;和&quot;盐&quot;都是<strong>每条消息新生成</strong>的——这让即便某条消息的密钥被攻破，也殃及不到其它消息。这一点与 <a href=\"../subscribe/vapid-keys\">VAPID 密钥与鉴权</a>里&quot;全站一把、极少轮换&quot;的身份密钥形成鲜明对比：身份密钥求稳定，加密密钥求一次性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ecdh-协商出共享密钥\">ECDH 协商出共享密钥</h2><p>核心是椭圆曲线 Diffie-Hellman（ECDH）在 P-256 曲线上的密钥协商。发件方用自己的临时私钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 乘以浏览器的公钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，浏览器用自己的私钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 乘以发件方的临时公钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，两边算出的是同一个点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_s \\cdot Q_c = d_s \\cdot (d_c \\cdot G) = d_c \\cdot (d_s \\cdot G) = d_c \\cdot Q_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个共享点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 坐标就是 ECDH 的原始共享密钥。它不直接当 AES 密钥用——还要经过两轮 HKDF（基于 HMAC 的密钥派生函数）：第一轮用 <code>auth</code> 当盐、把共享密钥和双方公钥混进去派生出&quot;中间密钥（IKM）&quot;，第二轮用消息级的 <code>salt</code> 派生出最终的 16 字节 AES-128 密钥和 12 字节 nonce。<code>auth</code> 的参与是关键——它让派生结果与&quot;这条具体订阅&quot;绑定，别的订阅算不出同一把密钥。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[发件方生成临时 ECDH 密钥对] --&gt; B[读订阅 p256dh 作为对方公钥]&#10;  B --&gt; C[ECDH 算共享密钥&lt;br/&gt;ds 乘 Qc]&#10;  C --&gt; D[HKDF 第一轮&lt;br/&gt;盐 = auth 派生 IKM]&#10;  D --&gt; E[HKDF 第二轮&lt;br/&gt;盐 = 消息 salt 派生 AES 密钥与 nonce]&#10;  E --&gt; F[AES-128-GCM 加密明文]&#10;  F --&gt; G[封装 aes128gcm 头 加 salt 与临时公钥]&#10;  G --&gt; H[POST 密文到 endpoint]\">flowchart TD\n  A[发件方生成临时 ECDH 密钥对] --&gt; B[读订阅 p256dh 作为对方公钥]\n  B --&gt; C[ECDH 算共享密钥&lt;br/&gt;ds 乘 Qc]\n  C --&gt; D[HKDF 第一轮&lt;br/&gt;盐 = auth 派生 IKM]\n  D --&gt; E[HKDF 第二轮&lt;br/&gt;盐 = 消息 salt 派生 AES 密钥与 nonce]\n  E --&gt; F[AES-128-GCM 加密明文]\n  F --&gt; G[封装 aes128gcm 头 加 salt 与临时公钥]\n  G --&gt; H[POST 密文到 endpoint]</pre><h2 id=\"aes-128-gcm-与-aes128gcm-内容编码\">AES-128-GCM 与 aes128gcm 内容编码</h2><p>派生出密钥后，负载用 AES-128-GCM 加密。GCM 是一种 AEAD（带关联数据的认证加密）模式，它同时提供机密性和完整性——解出的明文若被篡改过，16 字节的认证标签会验不过，浏览器直接丢弃。加密后的整体按 <code>aes128gcm</code> 内容编码封装，请求头写死一个值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Content-Encoding: aes128gcm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Encoding: aes128gcm</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个编码把 salt、记录大小、发件方临时公钥都塞进负载自带的一段二进制头里，浏览器解密时无需额外头字段就能复原全部材料。历史上还有一种更繁琐的 <code>aesgcm</code> 编码（要额外的 <code>Crypto-Key</code> 和 <code>Encryption</code> 头），2026 年已基本淘汰，新代码一律用 <code>aes128gcm</code>（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8291\">RFC 8291</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4kb-上限从哪来\">4KB 上限从哪来</h2><p>你一定会撞上一条硬限制：负载的明文实际可用空间只有约 <strong>3993 字节</strong>，远小于直觉里的 4KB。这不是浏览器抠门，而是从加密结构里精确算出来的。推送服务只被要求支持 4096 字节的记录体，这块预算要被下面几项瓜分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>占用项</th>\n<th>字节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>记录上限（推送服务保证支持）</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>aes128gcm</code> 头（含 salt 16 + rs 4 + 公钥长度 1 + 公钥 65）</td>\n<td>86</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>填充分隔符（padding delimiter，至少）</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GCM 认证标签</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>剩余可用明文</strong></td>\n<td><strong>≤ 3993</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4096</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3993</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4096 - 86 - 1 - 16 = 3993</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">86</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3993</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这解释了为什么<a href=\"service-worker-push\">SW 接收推送</a>里提到的&quot;无负载 tickle&quot;是一种真实策略：当你要发的内容超过 3993 字节（比如一段富文本、一张图的元数据加长文案），与其硬塞，不如只发一条空推送唤醒 Worker，再由它 <code>fetch</code> 去拉完整内容。把 4KB 当成&quot;通知摘要预算&quot;而非&quot;内容预算&quot;，是设计推送负载的正确心态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践中你几乎不手写它\">实践中你几乎不手写它</h2><p>上面的机制值得理解，但生产中你几乎不会亲手实现 ECDH 和 HKDF——<code>web-push</code>（Node）、<code>pywebpush</code>（Python）、<code>webpush-go</code>（Go）等库把整套加密封装在一次 <code>sendNotification</code> 调用里，你只传订阅对象和明文。手写加密极易出微妙错误（盐复用、nonce 计算错、公钥编码错），且这些错误在本地测试常常&quot;看起来能用&quot;，直到换一家推送服务才暴露。理解机制的价值在于：当库报&quot;加密失败&quot;或某浏览器收到消息却解不开时，你知道该去查订阅的 <code>p256dh</code>/<code>auth</code> 是否完整、是否用错了内容编码。库的选型见<a href=\"../practice/web-push-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RFC 8291 的负载加密是带数据推送的硬前提：推送服务只转发密文，读不到内容。</li>\n<li>加密靠 ECDH（P-256）在发收双方各自算出同一共享密钥，再经两轮 HKDF（第一轮盐用 <code>auth</code>、第二轮用消息 <code>salt</code>）派生出 AES-128 密钥与 nonce。</li>\n<li>负载用 AES-128-GCM（AEAD）加密，按 <code>aes128gcm</code> 内容编码封装；<code>aesgcm</code> 旧编码已淘汰。</li>\n<li>明文可用空间约 3993 字节（4096 减去头、填充、认证标签），超限就改用无负载 tickle 再 fetch。</li>\n<li>生产中用库完成加密，理解机制是为了排查&quot;某浏览器解不开消息&quot;这类问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>密钥 <code>p256dh</code>/<code>auth</code> 从何而来：<a href=\"../subscribe/push-subscription\">订阅 PushSubscription</a></li>\n<li>与之正交的身份机制：<a href=\"../subscribe/vapid-keys\">VAPID 密钥与鉴权</a></li>\n<li>解密发生在哪：<a href=\"service-worker-push\">SW 接收推送</a></li>\n<li>浏览器侧做同类加解密的底层接口：<a href=\"../../browser-and-web-api/storage-apis/origin-and-security\">浏览器 API · 源与安全</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"负载加密","id":"负载加密"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"加密要凑齐的四样东西","id":"加密要凑齐的四样东西"},{"level":2,"text":"ECDH 协商出共享密钥","id":"ecdh-协商出共享密钥"},{"level":2,"text":"AES-128-GCM 与 aes128gcm 内容编码","id":"aes-128-gcm-与-aes128gcm-内容编码"},{"level":2,"text":"4KB 上限从哪来","id":"4kb-上限从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"实践中你几乎不手写它","id":"实践中你几乎不手写它"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"SW 接收推送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-push-notifications/deliver/service-worker-push"},"next":{"title":"通知展示与交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-push-notifications/deliver/notification-display"}}